Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.98,Title,,0,0,40,,{\blur0.5}The Anticipating Capsule
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.31,0:00:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The Anticipating Capsule!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.62,0:00:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Here to drop off a delivery!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.62,0:00:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Please stamp here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.12,0:00:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.25,0:00:28.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Finally, it's arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:29.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I've been waiting for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Isn't this amazing? With this tool,\N I can fix anything in the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Is there anything that\Nyou want me to make?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.64,0:00:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nothing I can think of right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.64,0:00:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Then, is there anything\Nthat I need to fix?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.14,0:00:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Unfortunately, there's\Nnothing to fix either.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}However, isn't this\Nequipment expensive?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.77,0:00:51.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's little bit expensive...\NBecause this is the home series.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I want to use this soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.53,0:00:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.16,0:01:00.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm gonna go check\Nout the furniture store.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.03,0:01:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Alright, have a safe trip!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.37,0:01:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Mom, I have something that I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.92,0:01:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You want something?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.38,0:01:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You can use your \Nallowance to purchase it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's impossible to buy it\Nwith my allowance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.42,0:01:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Then restrain yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.80,0:01:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}If you can get a good score on your \Nnext test, I'll consider buying you a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.94,0:01:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Being a grown-up would be so nice...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.94,0:01:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The grown-ups can buy\Nwhatever they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.44,0:01:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}They can buy whatever they \Nwant because they have jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You can also become a grown-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.45,0:01:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I can't wait until\NI become a grown-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.45,0:01:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I want to buy things now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.45,0:01:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I can't do that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.16,0:01:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I know! The grown-ups works in order\Nto buy whatever they want, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So you're going to find a job?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.84,0:01:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's one way...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.96,0:01:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Can I borrow the items\Nfrom the future me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.10,0:02:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Borrowing the items from\Nthe future Nobita{\i1}-kun{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.48,0:02:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, I know!\NI have the gadget for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The Anticipating Capsule!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.98,0:02:15.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This capsule will allow\Nyou to rent any item...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.74,0:02:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}...from yourself, ten years \Nfrom now, for 30 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.49,0:02:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's great! Let's rent it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.12,0:02:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What should I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.62,0:02:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\an8}Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.62,0:02:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}First, put your hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.04,0:02:29.96,Typesetting,,0,0,0,,{\fad(484,0)\fnMontara Gothic\fs30\shad0\bord0\frz325.6\blur1\c&H040401&\pos(187.478,405.714)}Nobita Nobi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.88,0:02:33.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You can see yourself in the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.46,0:02:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Next, you can press the button and\Nsay the item that you want to rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.76,0:02:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}But, you're only able to rent\Nif the future Nobita{\i1}-kun{\i0} has it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.51,0:02:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Hmm, what should I rent...?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.97,0:02:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.64,0:02:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I want to borrow the jet plane\Nthat I'll have someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.52,0:02:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I want to rent my jet plane!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.11,0:02:55.15,Typesetting,,0,0,60,,{=24}{\fnQuicksand Medium\fs17\an2\shad0\bord0\blur0\c&H010103&\frx9\fry2\clip(m 224 77 l 236 74 246 71 257 69 268 67 279 65 287 64 298 63 307 62 319 63 327 63 339 64 350 65 359 66 371 68 383 69 397 72 412 77 429 83 440 88 447 91 458 96 467 102 479 108 489 116 498 123 504 128 507 132 512 136 517 142 520 146 525 152 529 160 533 165 536 172 553 229 554 299 537 348 481 413 374 451 279 452 216 440 142 405 94 358 74 312 67 259 78 196 106 148 160 103)\frz341.6\org(608,168)\pos(385.34,192)}The item that you want to rent isn't available in the future.
