Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.98,0:03:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}"The item that you want to rent isn't available in the future."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.03,0:03:07.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It means the future Nobita{\i1}-kun{\i0}\Ndoesn't have a jet plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.04,0:03:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's disappointing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.37,0:03:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whatever! The thing that I want\Nthe most right now is an RC car.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I want to rent an RC car!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.47,0:03:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whoa! It's a classic RC car!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.05,0:03:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The future me has good taste!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.02,0:03:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Remember! You can only\Nrent it for 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.69,0:03:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.36,0:03:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is so easy to control!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.82,0:03:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It runs really well!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.75,0:03:51.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I-I-I-It disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's because it's \N been 30 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What? 30 minutes already?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.79,0:04:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The latest Goro-Goro Comic about\NSuper Birdman is so interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.80,0:04:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah, I can't wait for the next issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.38,0:04:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I wonder what will happen next...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.80,0:04:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Did you hear that, Nobita{\i1}-kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.68,0:04:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I want to rent next month's \N Goro-Goro Comic!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.81,0:04:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whoa! The Anticipating\NCapsule is so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.70,0:04:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Birdman is so cool!
