Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.91,0:04:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Finally, it's over...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.70,0:04:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What are you reading, Nobita?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.29,0:04:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, it just Goro-Goro...{なんだ　ゴロゴロ...}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.08,0:04:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What? That wasn't this month's issue.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.21,0:04:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So it's next month's?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What happens next?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What does Super Birdman do?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.22,0:04:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}If you are curious,\Nyou can read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Thank you, Nobita!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.72,0:04:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Faster, faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.39,0:04:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}W-W-Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.56,0:04:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Here's the page, Super Birdman!
