Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.49,0:05:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You're so cool, Wataru{\i1}-san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.28,0:05:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.29,0:05:18.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You're not just handsome,\Nyou're also hardworking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No, I've just happened to be lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:25.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wataru{\i1}-kun{\i0}, since you were a child,\Nyou've always studied hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:30.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}That's true. I've always\Nadmired you, Wataru{\i1}-kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Speaking of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.81,0:05:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}When she was a little girl, Shizuka, would always say that, she wanted to marry Wataru{\i1}-kun{\i0}. in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:38.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Don't bring that up, Mom.\NIt's so embarrassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.36,0:05:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Shizuka{\i1}-chan{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.82,0:05:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}They seem so close to each other...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Doraemon, my future wife\Nis Shizuka{\i1}-chan{\i0}, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.82,0:05:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm not too sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The future can always change...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, no! It would be troublesome \N if the future were to change.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.16,0:05:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm just saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.83,0:06:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I know, we can just use \Nthe capsule to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.34,0:06:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll borrow this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:04.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You can't do that, Nobita{\i1}-kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.85,0:06:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I... I want to rent my future wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.99,0:06:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I must be dreaming now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.11,0:06:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I have to return to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.70,0:06:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Jaiko{\i1}-chan{\i0}...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.99,0:06:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Something might\Nhappen in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.00,0:06:40.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's have a look at that future.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.37,0:06:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}O-Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.50,0:06:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Go to the time right before we \Nrented the Future Jaiko{\i1}-chan{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.26,0:06:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Ladies and gentlemen,\Nplease clap your hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.65,0:07:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}As I expected, my future \N wife really is Jaiko-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.90,0:07:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}N-Nobita{\i1}-kun{\i0}?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.44,0:07:08.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita{\i1}-kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.36,0:07:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Takeshi{\i1}-san{\i0}, wake up!\NThe ceremony has started.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}No matter how happy he is,\Nhe drinks too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.83,0:07:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Christine{\i1}-sensei{\i0}, in her\Nwedding dress, is escorted by...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.58,0:07:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Her brother's best friend,\NNobi Nobita{\i1}-san{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.58,0:07:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Please give a round of applause!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.59,0:07:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Congratulations, Jaiko{\i1}-chan{\i0}...\NNo, I mean Christine{\i1}-sensei{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Your latest work, {\i1}Wedding Melon{\i0},\Nis really interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.60,0:07:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Thank you, Nobita{\i1}-san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.10,0:07:43.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Don't they look like\Na married couple?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.19,0:07:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Yeah, I think so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.48,0:07:50.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}This is not a wedding party,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}it's a release ceremony\Nfor her latest work.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.49,0:07:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He's not even listening to this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.49,0:07:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Now, the moment that everyone have been waiting for...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.99,0:08:02.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Christina Goda-{\i1}sensei{\i0} 's speech!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.25,0:08:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.25,0:08:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\q2}This is the moment when she disappeared\Nbecause of the Anticipating Capsule.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.01,0:08:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Go back to the time right after we\N rented the future Jaiko{\i1}-chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.34,0:08:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Nobita{\i1}-kun{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.51,0:08:18.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Wake up, Nobita{\i1}-kun{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.47,0:08:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Finally, you're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.48,0:08:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Where I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.39,0:08:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}We're back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.52,0:08:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I remember now! I passed out\Nat Jaiko{\i1}-chan{\i0}'s wedding party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.02,0:08:32.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}What should I do to fix my future?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.53,0:08:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}The party earlier wasn't \N your wedding party.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.99,0:08:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Then why was she wearing a wedding dress, if it's not a wedding party?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.00,0:08:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}It's for Jaiko-{\i1}chan{\i0} 's new \Nmanga, {\i1}Wedding Melon{\i0},
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.17,0:08:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}which has sold over \N500 million copies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.54,0:08:54.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}She was about to give her speech\Nwhen you pressed the rental request.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.51,0:08:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.22,0:09:01.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}So that means that I still might\Nget married to Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.56,0:09:03.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm not sure about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.93,0:09:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whatever happens to your future\Ncan still change from what it is now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.32,0:09:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You need to stay alert, Nobita{\i1}-kun{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.40,0:09:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}You never know if Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}\N will fall in love with someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.07,0:09:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\fad(0,361)}Ah, speaking of...
Dialogue: 1,0:09:16.57,0:09:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\fad(361,0)}Who was the high school guy earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.08,0:09:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'm going to check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.25,0:09:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}See you next time, Wataru{\i1}-san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.92,0:09:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}See you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.59,0:09:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Shizuka{\i1}-chan{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, Nobita{\i1}-san{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Who was that high school guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.05,0:09:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Oh, you mean Wataru{\i1}-san{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.68,0:09:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}He's my uncle's oldest son,\Nwho I've known since I was a kid
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.06,0:09:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Shizuka-{\i1}chan{\i0}, I will work hard,\Nharder than that guy did!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.81,0:09:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.77,0:09:53.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I'll work hard to try and \Npass the test this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.44,0:09:58.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}even though I can't get a perfect\Nscore like you and Dekisugi do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:10:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Isn't that a good thing...?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.41,0:10:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Because of that, please trust\Nand keep in touch in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.71,0:10:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I would like to rent \NNobita{\i1}-kun{\i0}'s next test results.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.76,0:10:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Whoa, this time Nobita{\i1}-kun{\i0}\Nreally worked hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.14,0:10:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}I need to rush back to\Ngive the speech now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.31,0:10:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Was it because I stayed up all night?\N This feels like a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.31,0:10:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}How do I get back to the ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.07,0:10:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Why does she look so weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:44.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}{\i1}What an idea for a mysterious story!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.95,0:10:47.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\be1}Let's write it now!

